<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani president to visit Uganda, Zimbabwe.</title>
<headline>Pakistani president to visit Uganda, Zimbabwe.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani President Farooq Leghari will lead a delegation to Uganda on a four-day visit beginning on Tuesday, a government announcement said on Monday.</p>
<p>Pakistan and Uganda will sign a memorandum of understanding to establish a bilateral business development forum and sign agreements for cooperation in various fields, it said.</p>
<p>Leghari will then go on to Zimbabwe to attend the solar summit in Harare opening on September 14, the announcement said.</p>
